CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
# The control plane maps this declared name from CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID_SECONDARY.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID
# Dedicated deployment health credential, stored directly in the protected
# production Environment and as a matching Cloudflare Worker Secret.
# Never alias or reuse any AIG_ACCESS_KEY_<GROUP> application credential.
# All provider, access, OAuth and node credential secrets remain in Cloudflare.
AIG_DEPLOY_HEALTH_KEY
